# A166084

Maximal volume of a closed box created by using at most n voxels as the boundary, skipping values of n for which the volume is the same as for n-1 and also skipping values of n for which volume(n)-n <= volume(n-1)-(n-1). In other words, the empty enclosed space must increase.

